Send document by email
post
https://api.icount.co.il/api/v3.php/doc/email
Request
Body

application/json

cid
string
Company identifier

user
string
Username

pass
string
Password

doctype
string
required
Document type

docnum
integer
required
Document number

orig
boolean
Original if true, copy if false.

hidenis
boolean
Hide ILS prices from document (only show foreign currency). Applicable only for documents in foreign currency and for languages other then he.

email_lang
string
Email language. This also affects the language of the document version. If not passed, current session language (API lang) will be used.

email_to
string
Email TO. If empty, assume email_to_client is true

email_to_client
boolean
Send email to default client email?

email_to_creator
boolean
Send email to document creator?

email_to_me
boolean
Send email to authenticated user?

email_cc
string
Email CC (Carbon Copy).

email_cc_client
boolean
Send CC to default client email?

email_cc_creator
boolean
Send CC to document creator?

email_cc_me
boolean
Send CC to authenticated user?

email_bcc
string
Email BCC (Blind Carbon Copy).

email_bcc_client
boolean
Send BCC to default client email?

email_bcc_creator
boolean
Send BCC to document creator?

email_bcc_me
boolean
Send BCC to authenticated user?

email_subject
string
Subject. If not passed, the system will generate one for You.

email_subject_prefix
string
Subject prefix. Only applicable when email_subject is not passed.

email_subject_suffix
string
Subject suffix. Only applicable when email_subject is not passed.

email_comment
string
Additional comment to place in the email body.

Responses
200
OK

